      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 1: New Lead Intake\n\n**Trigger:** Webhook receives lead data from RentEngine\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Validate lead has phone or email\n2. Check for duplicates in data table\n3. Assign leasing rep (round-robin)\n4. Send welcome SMS to lead\n5. Create callback task (due in 15 min)\n6. Notify leasing team via Slack\n\n**Error Handling:**\n- Invalid leads are logged\n- Duplicates are ignored\n- SMS/task/notification failures alert admin",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 1800,
        "color": 2
      },
